Fixes:
- Read the colour through the shared colour parser, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours tint the effect instead of turning white.
- Count time on a clock of 30 frames a second, the rate it was made for, so a 60 fps project plays it at the same speed.

